  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext>Resistance</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mtext>=</mtext><mfrac><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext>Volt</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext>Ampere</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/>We know, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mtext>    </mtext><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ε</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>  <br/>Hence, <br/><math><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ε</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ε</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mr